    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-canon-human=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>\"Endurance predation, but metaphysical.\"</em></p>\n<p><strong>Old Hunt (1/Soma Break).</strong> Choose a target you can see and mark them for 1 hour. You always know the direction to them, and once per turn you deal +tier damage to them when you hit.</p>\n<div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"humNeanderthalOldHunt\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Old Hunt</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Soma Break &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Action (mark target) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Mark target for 1 hour: know direction to them, deal +tier damage 1/turn on hit.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
